\name{CompositionalOMP-package}
\alias{CompositionalOMP-package}
\docType{package}
\title{
The Compositional Regression-Orthogonal Matching Pursuit Variable Selection algorithm
}
\description{
The CR-OMP variable selection algorithm is an adaptation of the gamma-OMP to compositional responses. Dirichlet regression or alpha-regression may be employed, and cross-validation is available for both models.
}
